@startuml
title E Visa Processing And Follow Up System - UML State Machine Diagram

state AccountCreation <<choice>>
state Login <<choice>>
state ApplicationSubmission <<choice>>
state PaymentConfirmation <<choice>>
state ApplicationAcceptance <<choice>>
state StatusView
state StatusCheck
state CancellationRequest
state DetailsModification
state FeedbackGiven
state Logout
state LoggedOut

AccountCreation:! [*] --> Login
Login: Login --> ApplicationSubmission
ApplicationSubmission: ApplicationSubmission --> PaymentConfirmation
PaymentConfirmation: PaymentConfirmation --> ApplicationAcceptance
ApplicationAcceptance: ApplicationAcceptance --> StatusView
StatusView: StatusView --> StatusCheck
CancellationRequest: Login --> CancellationRequest
DetailsModification: Login --> DetailsModification
FeedbackGiven: StatusCheck --> FeedbackGiven
Logout: DetailsModification | FeedbackGiven | ApplicationAcceptance | StatusView | CancellationRequest --> LoggedOut
LoggedOut: LoggedOut --> [*]
@enduml
